    "bbox": {
      "l": 79.02,
      "t": 720.0,
      "r": 540.0,
      "b": 669.38
    },
    "text": "(1 point) An input to the perceptron model is, x = [ x 0 , x 1 , · · · , x n ] T and the weight vector is w = [ w 0 , w 1 , · · · , w n ] T . The output from the perceptron is given by",
    "artifact_path": null
  },
