      "l": 95.8,
      "t": 618.01,
      "r": 540.0,
      "b": 585.3
    },
    "text": "where g ( x ) = w T x , then the decision boundary (i.e, the hyper-plane that separates the data points) passes through the origin in?",
    "artifact_path": null
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "type": "ListItem",
